#==============================================================================================
#
#   event_handler - HTML::EventHandler: the value and listener of an event handler
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/EventHandler.cpp (lines 1-37) and EventHandler.h. The
#       class was outside the skeleton's phase-1 closure; region r19 ported it because
#       DOM::EventTarget's event handler map holds these cells.
